        "TileImage": "$($repository fbc01079-8c4a-4213-84ca-c5f8629774eb).Image",
        "Description": "Greetings 47. Sophia Wilde’s operations helped fund the weapons Olander deals in. Now, Erik Olander is overseeing a weapons shipment in Marrakesh, aided by four soldiers who’ve been stealing the arms for his network. Eliminate Olander and his team to disrupt the flow of weaponry to extremists. This needs to be clean and efficient—no survivors, no traces. With this, we hit another vital point in the network’s supply chain.\r\rGood Luck 47",
